Subject: [PATCH 15/28] fix rkmpp drm validation followups

---
 doc/APIchanges              |  4 +--
 libavcodec/rkmppenc.c       | 71 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 libavutil/hwcontext_rkmpp.h |  8 +++++
 3 files changed, 81 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/doc/APIchanges b/doc/APIchanges
index e46e6369f6..77da2fda3c 100644
